rooms_desc ({"asasdasdasdasdasd","You are in a living room. The floor is covered with a thicksoft red carpet. In the centre of the room you can see somesitting pillows, and an low nihonese desk. In the northeastcorner of room is an altar, with two swords before it.At the walls are hanging various pictures, including a bigpicture of Shao - Ling closter.","You are in a Dojo. Sun is shining through south wall, which is made of glass. The ground is covered with tatami. In northeastcorner you can see a little altar which is sacrified to Kami ofa warrior. In the air you can smell the smog of candlesticksburning on altar. At the west wall is a big photo of Frank Shebeyand an old nihonese caligraphy.","As you enter the kitchen, your nose is attacked with some exotic smells.Mhmmmm, that smells good ...You can see a large cupboard, kitchen desk and an big cooking oven.At the desk is a smiling nihonese cook working with some fish.","You are in a garden. Sun is shining over high massive stone walls.There is a stone path through grass. A group of bonsai cherry trees full of white flowers is standing in north part of garden. Near treesyou can see a little lake with lotos flowers and goldfishes. Justbefore you is stone altar with statue of Amida Buddha.","You are in the garden. There is a stone path leading south throughgrass. You can see a group of little bonsai trees, and an oldgardener, which is raking loafs from grass. To the west ismassive stone wall, and to the east western wall of the house.You can see a balcony high over the garden.To the north is stone wall lower, so you can see the hill-sidedescending down to the pine forest, and a lake with small fishers junk. Far in the distance you can see Fuji-San mountaincovered with snow ...","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","balcony","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",})
